We need to parse the Turkish product list. Format: "Ürünler: 1) Kablosuz Kulaklık — 1.250,00 TL — 40 adet; 2) Mekanik Klavye — 2.100,50 TL — 15 adet; 3) USB Bellek — 180,00 TL — 200 adet."

We need JSON with "urunler": [ {ad:"...", fiyat:..., stok:...}, ...] preserving order.

We must convert price strings with Turkish decimal format: 1.250,00 means 1250.00. So need to replace '.' thousands separator and ',' decimal separator. So 1.250,00 -> 1250.00. 2.100,50 -> 2100.50. 180,00 -> 180.00.

Stok: numbers as integer.

Thus JSON:

{
  "urunler": [
    {"ad":"Kablosuz Kulaklık","fiyat":1250.00,"stok":40},
    {"ad":"Mekanik Klavye","fiyat":2100.50,"stok":15},
    {"ad":"USB Bellek","fiyat":180.00,"stok":200}
  ]
}

Make sure numbers are not quoted. Output only JSON object, no extra text.

